# Recommended Project Structure

```text
pikmoolya/
├── apps/
│   ├── mobile/                 # React Native + Expo
│   ├── web/                    # Next.js buyer/admin
│   └── api/                    # NestJS backend (Phase 2+)
│
├── services/
│   └── ml/                     # FastAPI + ML (Phase 3/4+)
│
├── packages/
│   ├── types/
│   ├── validation/
│   ├── constants/
│   ├── translations/
│   │   ├── en.json
│   │   ├── hi.json
│   │   └── mr.json
│   └── database/
│
├── database/
│   ├── migrations/
│   │   └── 001_initial_schema.sql
│   └── seeds/
│
├── infrastructure/
├── docs/
│   └── phase1/
│
├── .env.example
├── docker-compose.yml
└── README.md
```

## Phase 1 files

Put the design documents in:
`docs/phase1/`

Put the SQL schema in:
`database/migrations/001_initial_schema.sql`

Do not put backend TypeScript code in Phase 1.
